1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Which subway seat is always empty?

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:07,200
노약자석 (noyakjaseok)
End seats: seniors, disabled, pregnant.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,800
임산부 배려석 (imsanbu baeryeoseok)
The pink seat is for pregnant women.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,600
비어 있어도… (bieo isseodo…)
Empty? Nobody sits. No fine. Nunchi.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,200
양보해요 (yangbohaeyo)
So, which seat do you never take? 👇
